The temperature at the bottom of the sea is also falling very fast. We need to activate the Sphere of Fire in the Frozen Abyss of the Sea. Do not waste time; the sea people are in danger. The glacial river's flow must be stopped.

Please, go to the Frozen Abyss of the Sea, summon the Sphere of Fire and defeat 100 monsters.

A light on the ground will mark the right place to summon the Sphere of Fire. It is in your quest inventory.

Beware of the monsters around.

Come back here when you are done.
